Apply to the Standards block. Both bullets come out of one morning: a refusal
reader that was right about everything except the sentence it had to read, in a
file the host does not have. Full record: incident 10, lesson L22.

diff --git a/prompts/engineer-agent.md b/prompts/engineer-agent.md
